Sinnoh_ValorLakefront_Text_Person1:
	.string "CYNTHIA: TEAM GALACTIC set off a\n"
	.string "bomb at LAKE VALOR! The lake is...\l"
	.string "gone.\p"
	.string "Whatever they plan, it needs the\n"
	.string "three lake POKéMON. Go, I'll help the\l"
	.string "people here.$"

Sinnoh_ValorLakefront_Text_Person2:
	.string "We came to film the lake. Now we're\n"
	.string "filming a crater.$"

Sinnoh_ValorLakefront_Text_Person3:
	.string "The explosion shook the whole hotel.\n"
	.string "Everyone's okay, thank goodness.$"

Sinnoh_ValorLakefront_Text_Person6:
	.string "Don't go near the lake! Uh, for your\n"
	.string "own safety. Definitely not because\l"
	.string "we're busy there.$"

Sinnoh_ValorLakefront_Text_Person9:
	.string "My lakeside vacation is ruined.\n"
	.string "Someone owes me a refund. And a lake.$"

Sinnoh_ValorLakefront_Text_Person10:
	.string "I came to buy a piece of LAKE VALOR's\n"
	.string "famous lakeshore. Now it's just shore.$"

Sinnoh_ValorLakefront_Text_Person11:
	.string "BARRY: What happened here?! A bomb?!\n"
	.string "TEAM GALACTIC is going to pay! I'll\l"
	.string "fine them a million!$"

Sinnoh_ValorLakefront_Text_Sign8:
	.string "SEVEN STARS RESTAURANT\p"
	.string "Dinner and a double battle, every\n"
	.string "night.$"

